    B --> C[Learning DB Benchmark Query\ntwo-pass outlier filtering\nmedian-based bounds\nsampleSize >= 3 for confidence]

    C --> D[runQuoteOptimisation\nnormalise part names\ncompute NFS\nhidden damage estimate]

    D --> E[estimateComponentCost\nper-component AI estimate\nlabour and parts breakdown\nregional rate application]

    E --> F{Agreed cost\npresent?}
