    F -- No --> H[PRE_ASSESSMENT mode\noptimised_cost as benchmark\nsystem_optimised basis]

    G --> I[runCostDecision\ncostDecisionEngine\nanomaly detection\nrecommendation output]
    H --> I

    I --> J([return Stage9Output\ncostDecision, currency\nlearningDbBenchmark\nassumptions])

